      "data": {
        "text": "**Implementing Event Consumption**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing `consume_event.py`, the script to consume a single message from a managed subscription. This is a crucial step in the overall process, allowing us to process incoming events. The core logic of retrieving and handling the message is currently under development.\n\n\n",
