        "text": "**Developing Logging Strategy**\n\nOkay, I'm now focusing on creating `message_summary.py`. My primary strategy involves leveraging Google Cloud Logging for storing and analyzing the results of message processing. This approach should offer a scalable and readily accessible solution for monitoring and understanding the process outputs.\n\n\n",
